msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（It's 6:10...... Kushieda won't be here for＿a while yet, I guess......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Son las 6:10...... Supongo que Kushieda＿tardará un rato todavía......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... I came here at your＿insistence...... But I've got an idea of＿what you're thinking......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... Vine aquí porque＿insististe...... Pero ya me hago una＿idea de lo que estás pensando......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This box...... is obviously a Christmas＿present, right? And I'm meeting with＿Kushieda to give it to her......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esta caja...... es obvio que es un＿regalo de Navidad, ¿no? Y me reuniré＿con Kushieda para dárselo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Anyone could figure out the meaning＿behind it...... In other words, I was......＿interested in Kushieda, at the least......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Cualquiera entendería el sentido......＿O sea, yo...... al menos sentía interés＿por Kushieda......）」"

msgid "???「Yo!」"
msgstr "???「¡Ey!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, hey......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, hola......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「R-Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿D-De verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Ohh...... Deja vu......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ohh...... Déjà vu......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's right...... Back then, the night of＿Christmas Eve......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Es cierto...... Aquella vez,＿en Nochebuena......）」"

msgid "\"You make a nice bear, Takasu-kun.\""
msgstr "\"Te ves bien de oso, Takasu-kun.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「（I was wearing a bear costume,＿standing here...... waiting for Kushieda!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Llevaba un disfraz de oso, parado＿aquí...... ¡esperando a Kushieda!）」"

msgid "Minori「......Hey, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「......Oye, ¿Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Minori「I don't see Taiga around anywhere.」"
msgstr "Minori「No veo a Taiga por ningún lado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well, Taiga's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, Taiga está......」"

msgid "Minori「......?」"
msgstr "Minori「......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's right, that day...... No, back＿then...... Wait, why was I wearing a＿costume?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Es cierto, ese día...... No,＿aquella vez...... Espera, ¿por＿qué llevaba un disfraz?）」"

msgid "Minori「......Uhh, so basically, the one who＿needed little ol' me was you, huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ehm, o sea que quien necesitaba＿a mi humilde persona eras tú, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, yeah...... I don't know about＿\"needed\"...... Taiga just told me to come＿here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, sí...... No sé si \"necesitaba\"......＿Taiga solo me dijo que viniera＿aquí......」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, you see, it's just, she told me to go＿give this to you......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, verás, es que me dijo que＿viniera a darte esto......」"

msgid "Minori「That's some Christmasy wrapping, no＿doubt about it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ese envoltorio sí que es navideño,＿sin lugar a dudas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah, right you are, huh...... Anyway,＿take it. Seems it was meant for you to＿begin with, Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, tienes razón...... En fin,＿tómalo. Parece que era para ti desde＿el principio, Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「First...... Can I ask how much you've＿remembered?」"
msgstr "Minori「Antes...... ¿Puedo preguntar＿cuánto has recordado?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Minori「Why has Taiga done this?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por qué Taiga hizo esto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's what I want to know.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es lo que quiero saber.」"

msgid "Minori「So basically, you came here because＿Taiga told you to, not knowing the＿reason why?」"
msgstr "Minori「O sea que viniste porque Taiga te lo＿dijo, ¿sin saber cuál es la razón?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What took place before that is still＿fuzzy......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo que pasó antes de eso＿sigue borroso......」"

msgid "Minori「I see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......?」"

msgid "Minori「......What's with Taiga......? Why would＿she......? Why? Why?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Qué pasa con Taiga......? ¿Por＿qué haría......? ¿Por qué? ¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kushieda?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun...... I just think...... Maybe＿there are some things you're better off＿not remembering.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun...... Solo pienso......＿Tal vez hay cosas que es mejor＿que no recuerdes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「If...... if you never remember, it'll be like＿it never happened, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si...... si nunca lo recuerdas,＿será como si nunca hubiera＿pasado, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you...... What are you saying＿all of a sudden, Kushieda......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué estás...... Qué estás diciendo＿de repente, Kushieda......?」"

msgid "Minori「It would just be better in some＿cases...... For your sake, too.」"
msgstr "Minori「En algunos casos sería mejor así......＿Por tu bien, también.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For my sake?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por mi bien?」"

msgid "Minori「And for Taiga's sake...... and for my＿sake.」"
msgstr "Minori「Y por el bien de Taiga......＿y por el mío.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es......」"

msgid "Minori「Stop right there! Please don't say＿anything. You haven't remembered, so＿we can still rewrite the past.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Detente ahí! Por favor no digas nada.＿No lo has recordado, así que aún podemos＿reescribir el pasado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......!」"

msgid "Minori「Please.」"
msgstr "Minori「Por favor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh, that's right...... It felt like this back＿then too. Kushieda didn't let me say＿those crucial words......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah, es verdad...... Así se sintió＿aquella vez también. Kushieda no me dejó＿decir esas palabras clave......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That day, I was... rejected...）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ese día, fui... rechazado...）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I...... I liked...... Kushieda......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（A mí...... me gustaba......＿Kushieda......）」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Minori「Now then, Kushieda's gonna head on＿home.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, entonces Kushieda＿ya se va a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing ended up happening tonight,＿either.」"
msgstr "Minori「Al final tampoco pasó nada esta noche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, yo......」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing happened, right?」"
msgstr "Minori「No pasó nada, ¿cierto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「So, Takasu-kun, I'm leaving Taiga in＿your hands. Remember the incident＿this morning that I called you about?」"
msgstr "Minori「Así que, Takasu-kun, dejo a Taiga en＿tus manos. ¿Recuerdas el incidente de＿esta mañana por el que te llamé?」"

msgid "Minori「After that, I heard you solved her＿problem brilliantly. Taiga definitely＿needs you around, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Luego supe que resolviste su problema＿de maravilla. Sin duda Taiga te necesita＿cerca, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Minori「She shouldn't try to do things on her＿own. She should just come to you for＿advice.」"
msgstr "Minori「No debería intentar hacer las cosas＿sola. Debería simplemente acudir＿a ti para pedir consejo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Wait a second, Kushieda. Don't you＿think you've got it all wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Espera un segundo, Kushieda. ¿No＿crees que lo estás entendiendo mal?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ah, sí?」"

msgid "Minori「Then what? Are you saying I should sit＿back and let the irreversible happen?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Entonces qué? ¿Dices que me quede＿de brazos cruzados y deje que pase＿algo irreversible?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What the hell? Why would you say that,＿Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero qué rayos? ¿Por qué＿dices eso, Kushieda?」"

msgid "Minori「Right back at you. Why can't you just＿understand?」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo mismo digo. ¿Por qué simplemente＿no puedes entender?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Qué......!」"

msgid "Stop this pointless conflict"
msgstr "Detener esta discusión sin sentido"

msgid "This happened before......"
msgstr "Esto ya pasó antes......"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... What do you want me to do?＿Something besides just giving this to＿her, right? What more do you expect）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... ¿Qué quieres que haga?＿Algo más aparte de darle esto,＿¿no? ¿Qué más esperas）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（from this......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（de esto......?）」"

msgid "Minori「What's the deal with the getup,＿Takasu-kun? From a distance I could＿scarcely tell it was you! Though it's」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Y ese atuendo, Takasu-kun? ¡Desde lejos＿apenas noté que eras tú! ¡Aunque es」"

msgid "Minori「clearly an awesome suit!」"
msgstr "Minori「claramente un traje genial!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I don't know how that came about......＿But after I got here...... Huh? What＿happened? I feel like I'm grasping at）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......No sé cómo pasó todo eso......＿Pero al llegar aquí...... ¿Eh? ¿Qué＿pasó? Siento que intento agarrar）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（thorns......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（espinas......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, pretty much...... Though, I did＿remember something just now. This＿was the same place we met on the day」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, más o menos...... Aunque acabo＿de recordar algo. Este es el mismo＿lugar donde nos vimos el día」"

msgid "Ryuuji「of the Christmas party. Just like you＿were saying earlier.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「de la fiesta de Navidad. Tal como＿decías hace un momento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga is doing her best to try and be＿independent. Don't you think what＿you're suggesting would overlook her」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga se está esforzando mucho por＿ser independiente. ¿No crees que＿lo que sugieres ignora sus」"

msgid "Ryuuji「feelings?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「sentimientos?」"
